## Title: Under Pressure
## Author: Th3rtythr33
## Version: 0.2.6
## AddOnVersion: 8
## APIVersion: 101048 101049
## SavedVariables: UnderPressureSavedVars
## DependsOn: LibAddonMenu-2.0>=32
## Description: A passive HUD overlay for tanks. Shows a compact shape-based icon estimating how much incoming pressure you are under and a counter of how many distinct mobs are currently being tanked by you or your group. Helps tanks pick up unattached adds and helps non-tanks see how many mobs are loose. No automation.

; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
; APIVERSION NOTE
; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Set ## APIVersion to the current live console API number at upload time.
; - Update 47 = 101047
; - Update 48 = 101048
; - Update 49 = 101049 (current as of May 2026 per console addon videos)
; The format supports up to 2 space-separated values to cover a patch
; transition. Keep the most-recent value first.
; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

; Load order: bootstrap -> engine -> UI -> settings -> main entry

Engine/FeatureDetect.lua
Engine/AbilityClassifier.lua
Engine/AttackerTracker.lua
Engine/PressureEngine.lua
Engine/EventIngest.lua

UI/Indicator.xml
UI/Indicator.lua
UI/Debug.xml
UI/Debug.lua

